    "text": {
     "en": "Our solar system has the Sun at the centre and eight planets going round it, with moons, asteroids and comets.\nA star is a ball of hot gas that makes its own light. The Sun is our nearest star. The planets and moons shine by reflecting sunlight.\nOur Sun is one of billions of stars in the Milky Way galaxy, a huge spiral-shaped group of stars."
